    "id": "nordtest-6.3-recovery",
    "title": {
      "en": "Bias from recovery experiments",
      "tr": "Geri kazanım deneylerinden sapma"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Nordtest TR 537 §6.3: u(bias) from six spike recoveries.",
      "tr": "Nordtest TR 537 §6.3: altı katkı geri kazanımından u(bias)."
    },
    "explanation": [
      {
        "en": "Recoveries 95, 98, 97, 96, 99, 96 %: biases R − 100 %, RMS_bias = 3.44 %.",
        "tr": "Geri kazanımlar %95, 98, 97, 96, 99, 96: sapmalar R − %100, RMS_bias = %3,44."
      },
      {
        "en": "Uncertainty of the added amount: concentration of the spike solution 1.2/2 = 0.6 %, volume (±1 % rectangular → 1/√3 = 0.58 %, and 0.5 %) → u(C_recovery) = √(0.6² + 0.58² + 0.5²) = 0.97 % ≈ 1.0 %.",
        "tr": "Eklenen miktarın belirsizliği: katkı çözeltisi derişimi 1,2/2 = %0,6, hacim (±%1 dikdörtgen → 1/√3 = %0,58 ve %0,5) → u(C_geri kazanım) = √(0,6² + 0,58² + 0,5²) = %0,97 ≈ %1,0."
      },
      {
        "en": "u(bias) = √(3.44² + 0.97²) = 3.6 %.",
        "tr": "u(bias) = √(3,44² + 0,97²) = %3,6."
      }
    ],
    "field": "chemistry",
    "sources": [
      {
        "document": "Nordtest TR 537 ed. 4 (2017), Handbook for calculation of measurement uncertainty in environmental laboratories",
        "section": "§6.3",
        "url": "https://nordtest.info/images/documents/nt-technical-reports/NT_TR_537_edition4_English_Handbook_for_calculation_of_measurement_uncertainty_in_environmental_laboratories.pdf"
      }
    ],
